DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN
# The token used to log the bot into Discord, from the Discord Developer Portal.

DISCORD_CHAT_CHANNEL_ID
# The Discord channel the chat bridge posts to and reads from.
# To get a channel's ID, enable Developer Mode (User Settings → Advanced), then right-click the channel → Copy Channel ID.

DISCORD_MEMBER_LOG_CHANNEL_ID
# The Discord channel member-join/leave/profile-update events are logged to (administration_module.log).
# To get a channel's ID, enable Developer Mode (User Settings → Advanced), then right-click the channel → Copy Channel ID.
